WEBVTT

00:00:14.885 --> 00:00:16.552
Not another war.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.561
That is what we are fighting.

00:00:26.897 --> 00:00:28.272
That is the enemy.

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:31.484
Their arrogance.

00:00:32.986 --> 00:00:34.695
Their power lust.

00:00:36.948 --> 00:00:38.366
Their barbarity.

00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:44.038
How long will it take
before they turn their weapons on us?

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.709
Do nothing when I speak of this.

00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:51.587
You must remain calm

00:00:53.882 --> 00:00:55.674
and contain your emotions.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.181
There are Aurors here among us.

00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:03.891
(PANICKED MURMURING)

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.236
Come closer, brother wizards. Join us.

00:01:16.988 --> 00:01:18.155
Do nothing.

00:01:19.408 --> 00:01:20.699
And no force.

00:01:36.425 --> 00:01:39.552
GRINDELWALD: They have killed
many of my followers.

00:01:40.345 --> 00:01:41.512
It is true.

00:01:42.764 --> 00:01:46.976
They confined me
and tortured me in New York.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:52.398
They had struck down
their fellow witches and wizards.

00:01:54.025 --> 00:01:58.446
For the simple crime
of seeking the truth.

00:02:00.198 --> 00:02:01.991
For wanting freedom.

00:02:06.705 --> 00:02:10.249
Your anger, your desire for revenge
is natural.

00:02:12.752 --> 00:02:13.752
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:02:14.171 --> 00:02:15.171
GRINDELWALD: No!

00:02:46.203 --> 00:02:49.788
Take this young warrior
back to her family.

00:02:57.964 --> 00:02:59.131
Disapparate.

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:00.925
Leave.

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:04.970
Go forth from this place
and spread the word.

00:03:06.306 --> 00:03:09.517
It is not we who are violent.

00:03:27.661 --> 00:03:28.869
Let's take him.

00:03:49.599 --> 00:03:51.642
(SCREAMING)

00:03:57.983 --> 00:04:01.777
Aurors, join me in this circle.

00:04:03.613 --> 00:04:05.030
Pledge to me

00:04:06.283 --> 00:04:07.825
your eternal allegiance,

00:04:08.743 --> 00:04:09.827
or die.

00:04:10.495 --> 00:04:12.371
Only here shall you know freedom.

00:04:12.956 --> 00:04:15.499
Only here shall you know yourself.

00:04:18.795 --> 00:04:21.422
AUROR: Move! Run! Run!

00:04:22.632 --> 00:04:24.717
Play by the rules!

00:04:24.884 --> 00:04:27.511
- No cheating, children.
- (AURORS SCREAMING)

00:04:32.309 --> 00:04:33.892
He knows who I am.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:37.438
He knows what you were born,
not who you are!

00:04:37.522 --> 00:04:38.606
NEWT: Credence!

00:04:53.788 --> 00:04:56.332
Queenie, honey. Queenie.
You gotta wake up.

00:04:58.084 --> 00:04:59.168
Jacob.

00:05:00.003 --> 00:05:01.253
He's the answer.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.671
He wants what we want.

00:05:02.839 --> 00:05:04.214
- No.
- Yeah.

00:05:14.184 --> 00:05:17.144
This has all been for you, Credence.

00:05:20.106 --> 00:05:21.523
Walk with me.

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:24.943
Hon. No!

00:05:25.111 --> 00:05:26.654
Walk with me!

00:05:28.657 --> 00:05:30.074
You're crazy.

00:05:32.494 --> 00:05:33.494
Queenie.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:35.120
No!

00:05:35.288 --> 00:05:36.914
Queenie, don't do it!

00:05:44.923 --> 00:05:45.923
Queenie.

00:05:48.593 --> 00:05:49.593
TINA: Queenie!

